            <title>[IGNITE-5335] Wrong value read by SQL query for field containing negative decimal</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5335</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;br/&gt;
1) Create a cache with value type having some decimal field.&lt;br/&gt;
2) Instantiate a value, intialize decimal field with a negative value and put it to the cache.&lt;br/&gt;
3) Perform an sql query on the decimal field.&lt;br/&gt;
4) Check the selected value.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
